<h2>Coordinated Operating Strategy Dashboard</h2>
<p class="teaser">An operational envelope that unifies machine learning models, system of records, and strategic initiatives into a single, evidence-based view for making faster, more reliable decisions across plant operations. Currently in development.</p>
<input type="password" id="passwordInput" placeholder="Enter password to view case study" autofocus/>
<button onclick="checkPassword()">Unlock</button>
